  "scope_note": "Server only. Desktop UI, physical NAT matrix and public deployment remain unaccepted under their own changes. Root workspace vendor is blocked by unrelated missing OneIsland packages; readonly module mode retains go.work and changes no production routing. Added /v1/network/join (login-free enrollment by networkId, device owned by network owner) and per-network maxDevices capacity (default 10, owner may raise to 20/30; enforced on enroll/join/bind). Desktop UI, physical NAT matrix and public deployment remain unaccepted under their own changes.",
